     <img alt=\"GSN May 2026 free articles (2)\" src=\"https://info.greenstreet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/GSN%20May%202026%20free%20articles%20(2).png?width=1200&amp;upscale=true&amp;name=GSN%20May%202026%20free%20articles%20(2).png\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; border:none; max-width:100%; font-size:16px\" width=\"600\" align=\"middle\" class=\"stretch-on-mobile\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table></div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 20px 0px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17630485955432\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17630485955432_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><p style=\"line-height:280%; text-align:center; font-size:14px; font-family:'Rethink Sans', sans-serif; font-weight:medium\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #49b065;\"><strong>DOWNLOAD YOUR FREE NEWS ARTICLE</strong></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 20px 10px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17630485955433\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17630485955433_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><h2 style=\"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:115%; font-family:'Rethink Sans', sans-serif; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #04504f;\">Gain free access to what institutional CRE investors are reading right now<br></span></h2></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:5px 30px 10px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17630485955434\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17630485955434_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #3c3c3c;\"><span style=\"color: #49b065;\"><a href=\"https://greenstreetnews.com/europe/?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=prospect-list&amp;utm_campaign=GSN-MAY-2026-TOP-ARTICLES&amp;utm_term=news&amp;utm_content=email-1\" style=\"color:#49b065\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"xkU6qrGF\" target=\"_blank\">Green Street News</a></span></span><span style=\"color: #3c3c3c;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #000000;\">has unlocked five of its most-read exclusive stories from May 2026, free to access with no subscription required. </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Our journalism is normally behind a paywall. This is your chance to read it first-hand.<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Coverage includes: </span></span></p>\n<ul style=\"line-height:150%\">\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Former GIC executive Jonathan Lai's new asset management firm, Astrolabe Advisors, and its first pan-European mandate.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A £282 million bidding&nbsp;race for One St James's Square, arguably London's most prestigious office address.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Brookfield and Experimental Group's €400 million+ European luxury hotel portfolio, now on the market via JLL.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"line-height:175%\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">How the CEOs of CBRE and JLL collectively earned $39 million in 2025, nearly three times their combined pay a decade ago.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Principal Financial Group's plans to raise $3 billion for new US and European data centre funds, targeting 18–20% net IRR.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Choose the story most relevant to you and download it for free below.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_17767017651234\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px